# Private data and planning material. D-03: data/, research/ and logs/ never enter
# git in any form; this fleet extends D-03 to sop/ and fleet/, which are private
# planning material of the same class. A slip here publishes the SOP and the fleet plan.
data/
research/
logs/
sop/
fleet/
# RUNLOG.md is the fleet's own evidence log. It is not in the section 2.1 tree
# and it names fleet/ paths and step internals, so D-03 covers it too.
RUNLOG.md

# Two directories in the section 2.1 tree are named data/ and hold source, not data:
# the Shiny app's bundled aggregates (app/data/) and the DT-* data tests
# (tests/data/). The data/ pattern above is unanchored on purpose, so it would
# otherwise swallow both. Re-include exactly those two paths and nothing else.
!app/data/
!tests/data/

# Generated model and table artifacts. out/ itself is tracked; only the heavy
# formats under it are not.
out/**/*.parquet
# Local development artefacts (synthetic designs, recovery replicates, benchmark fits).
# tests/unit/test_exports.py skips this tree only while it is ignored and untracked.
out/dev/
out/models/**/*.rds
out/models/**/*.npz
# Chapter 1 fitted objects and posterior draws (W3.14 to W3.21). A bam object on the five-season
# sample runs to hundreds of megabytes, and the B1 cells and B2 fits hold per-umpire estimates that
# CH1-A6 and D-21 keep unpublished. Their provenance.json receipts beside them are tracked.
out/ch1/model/*.rds
# Chapter 1 run logs and step markers (scripts/ch1_sprint.sh): machine paths and timings, not results.
out/ch1/log/*.log
out/ch1/log/.done/

# Secrets and local environment
.env
.Renviron

# Python and R environments
.venv/
renv/library/
renv/staging/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Warehouse
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
warehouse/

# Spreadsheets. SBRO workbooks are never committed (W8.15 compliance gate).
*.xlsx

# dbt
dbt/target/
dbt/dbt_packages/
dbt/logs/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Quality runner lock. A lock file names a running process, not a result.
quality/steps.d/.merge.lock

# D-21 / annex 8.5: no per-umpire table is published; the F4 sidecar stays local (DEV-83)
out/tables/F4_data.csv
# generated by submissions/ssac2027/build/build_html.py; the PDF is the tracked product
submissions/ssac2027/build/abstract.html
# unchosen exhibit candidates (abstract/exhibits/chosen.txt names the two that ship); their numbers are not ledger-traced
abstract/exhibits/plane-convention-vs-corrected/
abstract/exhibits/zone-edges-three-periods/
submissions/ssac2027/build/*-with-caption.png
